# Packages
#-- LLC30 lightweight verification config (Task 4). useEXCH2 is
#   deliberately NOT listed: this namelist variable does not exist
#   anywhere in MITgcm source (confirmed by grepping model/, pkg/,
#   eesupp/ -- zero hits); pkg/exch2 is enabled purely at compile time
#   via code/packages.conf. useCAL is set explicitly (not left to the
#   useEXF-implies-useCAL default, which was removed at checkpoint66d).
#-- Phase A (adjoint-experiment plan, see HANDOFF.md): added
#   useGMRedi/useSeaice/useShelfIce/useSTIC/useSALT_PlUME/
#   useDiagnostics to match real V4r6's forward package list minus
#   sbo. useShelfIce+useSTIC together (not STIC alone) confirmed from
#   the real confirmed-stable run_shelfice_v2_fixed_check/data.pkg.
#-- Phase B (this input_ad/, adjoint-experiment plan): added
#   useGrdchk/useCTRL/useECCO/useProfiles/useSMOOTH, now that
#   pkg/ctrl/pkg/ecco/pkg/profiles/pkg/smooth are compiled in code_ad/.
 &PACKAGES
 useEXF   =.TRUE.,
 useCAL   =.TRUE.,
 useGGL90 =.TRUE.,
 useGMRedi=.TRUE.,
 useSeaice=.TRUE.,
 useShelfIce=.TRUE.,
 useSTIC=.TRUE.,
 useSALT_PlUME=.TRUE.,
 useDiagnostics=.TRUE.,
 useGrdchk=.TRUE.,
 useCTRL=.TRUE.,
 useECCO=.TRUE.,
 useProfiles=.TRUE.,
 useSMOOTH=.TRUE.,
 &
